+### tool_mobile
+
+#### Added
+
+- A new admin setting `tool_mobile/enabledeeplinkautologin` (Site administration > Mobile app > Mobile authentication) has been added to explicitly allow auto-login via deep links. The WS tool_mobile_get_public_config now always returns the `tool_mobile_enabledeeplinkautologin` setting.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-88924](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-88924)
+
 ### core_user
 
 #### Changed
